---
/**
 * Manifesto — §2 "The idea".
 * Four paragraphs verbatim from the copy doc, italic emphasis preserved.
 * P2 ("a slow-motion emergency") is the boldest moment on the site —
 * give it room to breathe. No paraphrasing, no smoothing.
 */
---

<section id="manifesto" class="section manifesto" aria-labelledby="manifesto-eyebrow">
  <div class="container manifesto__inner">
    <p id="manifesto-eyebrow" class="eyebrow manifesto__eyebrow">The idea</p>

    <div class="manifesto__body">
      <p class="manifesto__p">
        We felt <em>disconnected</em> too. From the food we ate. From the hands that grew it. From the land, the seasons, <em>each other</em>.
      </p>

      <p class="manifesto__p">
        And it wasn't just a feeling. Monocrops were stripping the soil bare. Poultry came dosed with antibiotics and saline. Produce was grown in chemicals strong enough to kill what pollinates it. <em>"Fresh"</em> had started to mean shipped, gassed, and dressed up to look alive. We were eating it too. A slow-motion emergency. We called it normal.
      </p>

      <p class="manifesto__p">
        We wanted somewhere that closed the gap. Where animals fertilise the soil, the soil grows the food, and what we don't eat feeds the animals. <em>Nothing wasted. Nothing pretending.</em>
      </p>

      <p class="manifesto__p">
        A place for long tables, open fires, and <em>people who want to reconnect</em> — with food, with soil, with each other.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto {
    background: var(--bg-dark);
  }

  .manifesto__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(140px, 1fr) minmax(0, 4fr);
    gap: clamp(24px, 6vw, 96px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .manifesto__eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: 12px;
  }

  .manifesto__body {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-10);
    max-width: 38ch;
  }

  .manifesto__p {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--fg-on-dark-1);
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.4vw, 36px);
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: var(--ls-heading);
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .manifesto__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--s-8);
    }
    .manifesto__eyebrow {
      padding-top: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
